{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23333","headline":"花前叹 · 白居易","name":"花前叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前岁花前五十二，今年花前五十五。\n岁课年功头发知，从霜成雪君看取。\n几人得老莫自嫌，樊李吴韦尽成土。\n南州桃李北州梅，且喜年年作花主。\n花前置酒谁相劝，容坐唱歌满起舞。\n欲散重拈花细看，争知明日无风雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}